Scope of this licence
=====================

This licence covers the code and documentation written for this repository: everything
under scripts/, tests/, experiments/, docs/ and release/.

It does not cover two other things in this tree.

Files under data/raw/ were downloaded from other publishers and remain under their terms.
The METR report page and its chart assets carry "(c) 2026 METR. All rights reserved."
The collusion.wiki archive files came from a download page carrying a draft and
no-sharing banner. data/source_manifest.json records the URL, retrieval date and SHA-256
of each one.

Files under data/external/ are third-party source trees that carry their own licence
files, for example data/external/llama_conversion_source/llama.cpp-5266f24da/LICENSE.

The derived tables in data/processed/ are published separately under CC BY 4.0. See
release/README.md and release/LICENSE.

